        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-S7, Contemporary Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Square Mount Towel Bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch. The modern, square design makes for a clean look. It is available in brushed nickel or polished chrome finishes. The contemporary towel bar is at the peek of what is hot in home decorating, so update your bathroom with this easy to install accessory. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-toilet-tissue-holder-fusion-ph-s7\"><b>Fusion PH-S7 Contemporary Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-S7</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-S7</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-S7</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
